[I] C++ port of the popular Java Lucene library

[T] Lucene++ is a C++ port of the popular Java Lucene library, a
[T] high-performance, full-featured text search engine. It provides the
[T] liblucene++ and liblucene++-contrib libraries for indexing and searching
[T] documents.

[U] https://github.com/luceneplusplus/LucenePlusPlus

[A] Lucene++ Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

